	)>>.
	<br><br>
	<<ind>><<link [[Take it|Mine Antique]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mine_links>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $settings.tentaclesEnabled and $hallucinations gte 2>>
	<<addinlineevent "tentacles">>
		You explore the dim tunnel, until you step on something soft. You look down and see a tentacle on the ground. It wraps around your leg.
		As you try to wrestle free, a slew of other tentacles emerge from the darkness.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Mine Tentacle]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set _relativeWeight++>>
<</if>>

<<if $settings.slimesEnabled and $hallucinations gte 1>>
	<<addinlineevent "slimes">>
		As you're exploring a damp tunnel, you feel something wet land on your back. You reach to wipe it off, and find a large slime. You look up to see several more about to fall on you.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Mine Slime]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set _relativeWeight++>>
<</if>>

<<if !$mine.tunnel.intro>>
	<<addinlineevent "collapsed">>
		As you're exploring, you come across a steep decline. It's covered in mud. You step onto it before <span class="red">you slip on the mud and slide down the tunnel.</span>
		You reach the bottom and land on hard rock. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Recover|Mine Collapse Intro]]>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if $settings.lurkersEnabled>>
	<<addinlineevent "lurkers">>
		As you're exploring, you see movement in the corner of your eye. You turn to look, but it's gone. As you're about to continue on, camouflaged creatures fly at you from the wall.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Mine Struggle]]>><<set $struggle_start to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set _relativeWeight++>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "creature" _relativeWeight>>
	<<generateStrangeCreature 1>><<person1>>
	As you're exploring, you come across a dark tunnel. You venture forward, making your way through, until you hear small rocks fall behind you.
	You turn to look, but nothing's there. You turn to continue, only to see a shape standing in front of you. It lunges, inhuman arms grabbing your body.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Creature Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

