:: Mine Swim
You enter the water. It's warm.
<br><br>
<<water>><<effects>>
You take a deep breath before you dive below the surface. You swim down and follow the tunnel.
<br><br>
<<if $swimmingSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You continue, until you reach an incline and an unflooded section of tunnel.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Follow the tunnel|Mine Diamond]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You start to run out of breath.</span> You desperately try to return from where you came, but everything starts to go dark. You feel a cold hand grasp your ankle as everything fades to black.
	<<passout>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Follow the tunnel|Mine Swim Fail]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Swim Fail
<<effects>>

You awaken with a gasp. You cough up water onto the ground.
<br><br>
You look around to see that you're back in the entrance of the mines.

<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Diamond
<<effects>>

As you walk down the dark tunnel, you notice a trail of torn clothing. The scraps lead to a crack in the tunnel wall, just large enough to fit in. You take a look inside and see something shining in the center of a cave.
<br><br>
You squeeze through the small gap. You shudder as you step onto the soft ground. You look around and see that the cave is covered with a fleshy substance. <<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
<br><br>
You approach the center of the cave, wet sounds accompany you. As you get close, you realize it's a <span class="lewd">purple diamond</span> sitting on a pedestal in the center of the cave. As you peer at it, you realize just how beautiful it is. You can't bear to look away.
<br><br>
<!-- Duplicate links are intentional -->
<span class="wraith"><<link [[Take it|Mine Diamond Take]]>><</link>></span>
<br>
<span class="wraith"><<link [[Take it|Mine Diamond Take]]>><</link>></span>




:: Mine Diamond Take
<<effects>><<wearProp "antique purple diamond">><<earnFeat "Rock Bottom">>
<<set $mine.tunnel.diamond to 1>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquepurplediamond" "found">>
<<set $antiquemoney += 5000>>

You reach out to touch the diamond, as your fingers meet the diamond, a warmth fills you.
<<orgasm>>
You recover, then reach back through the crack to grab a scrap of clothing. You wrap the diamond in the clothing scrap and lift it off its pedestal.
<br><br>
You return through the crack and continue down the tunnel, until you reach a fork. One of them leads to an incline. You follow it, until the silence is cut by <span class="red">a loud roar from behind you.</span> <<stress 20>><<gggstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Run|Mine Diamond Escape]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Diamond Escape
<<effects>>

You run as fast as you can through the tunnel. The incline gets steeper and steeper. <span class="red">Another loud roar echoes from behind. It's louder than the last.</span>
<br><br>
The tunnel levels out. You glimpse light in the tunnel ahead, just as <span class="red">yet another loud roar echoes.</span>
<br><br>
You glance around, and see a large monster on your heels. You scramble away, but it swings its arm into one of the wooden supports. The tunnel rumbles. You rush to the light as it begins to collapse.
<br><br>
You make it to a small cave, and drop to the ground, trying to cover yourself. The rumbling stops. You look back to see the tunnel has caved in, as though it never existed to begin with. You look around. <span class="green">You're back at the entrance.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



